# The rogue's whole passive: LUK, which is the stat a rogue's damage is built
# on. GMS grants 2 a level over 10 levels; this grants 1 over 20, ending at the
# same +20. Halving it is what keeps the skill in line with its peers -- 20 LUK
# is worth about 13% more damage at level 30, near enough to Critical Shot's
# 14%, where the full 40 would have made it the best passive in the game.
# The wiki says "Luck"; every stat this game shows the player says LUK.
name: "Nimble Body"
description: "Permanently increases LUK."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ROGUE skill_order: 3 }
max_level: 20
base {
  luk: 1
}
per_level {
  luk: 1
}
